      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"This planet is old, friend, and Czerka desperately wanted what's buried within. Scores of mercenaries have been sent down there, and it's on me to try to make sure that they come out alive. Most don't. Don't ask me more, lest we invite a legion of Czerka's lawyers to descend upon me. I'll say more when I can.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
